{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md","title":"K and Gödel Set Equivalent","display":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent","aliases":["92-thm-k-g-equivalent"],"display":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent","depends_on":["[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-df-godel-set]]","[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]","[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-lem-rosser-separation]]"],"source":"第 VI 章 pp. 78–80；第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 95–97、103–106）；本地归约推论","source_status":"Shepherdson 表示的本地可计算论推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-k-g-equivalent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-k-g-equivalent — K and Gödel Set Equivalent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b356f91d7193d28\" href=\"?note=5b356f91d7193d28\" title=\"92-df-many-one-reducible\">92-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7745a6d434bbe885\" href=\"?note=7745a6d434bbe885\" title=\"92-thm-shepherdson-representation\">92-thm-shepherdson-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a769d89316a99993\" href=\"?note=a769d89316a99993\" title=\"92-df-finite-order-system\">92-df-finite-order-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8d06776406d2e58e\" href=\"?note=8d06776406d2e58e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system\">92-df-smullyan-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"323282b93f22ef06\" href=\"?note=323282b93f22ef06\" title=\"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system\">92-df-effective-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"521018a78a163e38\" href=\"?note=521018a78a163e38\" title=\"92-lem-rosser-separation\">92-lem-rosser-separation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 pp. 78–80；第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 95–97、103–106）；本地归约推论"},{"key":"source_status","html":"Shepherdson 表示的本地可计算论推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (Gödel set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic adequacy for representing computations)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\equiv_m K_G\">\\(K \\equiv_m K_G\\)</span> : 停机集与Gödel集多一等价</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K \\leq_m K_G\">\\(K \\leq_m K_G\\)</span>：停机问题可归约到可证性问题</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G \\leq_m K\">\\(K_G \\leq_m K\\)</span>：可证性问题可归约到停机问题</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>系统G可以模拟程序执行（算术化）</li>\n<li>用原书 Shepherdson 表示定理取得停机集的普通表示公式，再把输入数码实例的结论码计算出来；仅有通常停机句的正数码验证不能替代该双条件</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>不相容，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>退化为全部句子码，原来的无条件等价结论失败</li>\n<li>这建立了不完备性与停机问题的联系</li>\n<li>两者通过完备归约紧密相连，但不完备性定理并非Rice定理或停机不可判定性的字面“同一个定理”</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>普通相容性不能充当任意 Σ1 停机句的可靠性。先取得 Shepherdson 的普通表示公式 F，使 n∈K 恰当且仅当 G⊢F(n)，再计算其数码实例的结论码，才有 K≤mK_G；反向由搜索 G 的证明得到。未构造具体机器索引实现。</p>\n<p>在固定 PA 上应用原书的 Rosser 分离条件还需核对语言转换：将 P.A. 的变量串译为本地变量 token、后继 accent 译为 S、加乘函数译为 +/·、原始 ≤ 译为本地加法关系。PA 以数码计算、数码互异、对有限数码界的归纳及加法序的比较证明原书 (R) 的 Ω₁–Ω₅；其中后两项正是 FinOrder_G。第 VI 章的分离构造不依赖一致性，并对任意有限元数作同一构造，给出二元 RosserRel_G²；闭句证明枚举给出 Axable_G。然后才结合 Con(G) 调用 Shepherdson。</p>\n<p>这说明当前固定 PA 为何满足该表示定理的前提，不把任意“含 Q 的三元组”按同名直接代入。原书字符级证明翻译与相关基础算术推导仍是这里的数学论证，没有编译为机器证明。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 pp. 78–80；第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 95–97、103–106）；本地归约推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-many-one-reducible","status":"resolved","id":"5b356f91d7193d28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-many-one-reducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-shepherdson-representation","status":"resolved","id":"7745a6d434bbe885","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-finite-order-system","status":"resolved","id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"8d06776406d2e58e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-effective-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"323282b93f22ef06","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-effective-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-rosser-separation","status":"resolved","id":"521018a78a163e38","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-rosser-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K$ (halting set, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_G$ (Gödel set, see [[92-df-godel-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}k\\text{-}g\\text{-}equivalent}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(K\\leq_m K_G\\land K_G\\leq_m K\\land K\\equiv_m K_G\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"K \\equiv_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K \\leq_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G \\leq_m K","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":3615,"backlinks":[{"id":"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"从停机集到定理码集合的多一归约给出统一不可判定性；仅由存在一个未判定句，不足以排除定理集合可判定。使用[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]的表示归约与停机不可判定性。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]"}],"outgoing":["06a154edf19ea063","d8d33d47202e6d60","5b356f91d7193d28","c7befd96bd551ade","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","7745a6d434bbe885","a769d89316a99993","8d06776406d2e58e","323282b93f22ef06","521018a78a163e38","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}